msgstr ""
"Spremeni se le izris napovedi; povzetki in paketni zagoni ohranijo svoje "
"vrednosti."

#. Translators: resets a marker's display window to Cellaris's own.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:622
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Ponastavi"

